figdown 0.1 block
# `VERBATIM-REGION-SCOPE`: `[ ]` is a verbatim region for `#` too. SYNTAX-STYLE §1
# names four verbatim regions and `;` has been honoured in all four since
# 0.1; `#` was honoured in three, because comment stripping ran before
# edge dispatch and knew nothing about brackets. `edge a -[hop #1]-> b` used
# to report `unterminated [label]`, and `#1`/`#2` is the natural spelling for
# hop and sequence numbers in the protocol figures this language targets.
node a "A"
node b "B"
edge a -[hop #1]-> b
edge a -["hop #2"]-> b
edge a -[hop #3]-> b   # a real trailing comment still ends the line
edge a -> b stroke=#0d9488
